# Summary

This is a client commission for an ARPG (art role playing game) fantasy genetics roller. It will include a breeding roller and a randomizer roller.

# Stack

- Vanilla JavaScript
- NPM
- Tailwind (w/ Tailwind CLI)
- Prettier

# Styling

Always prefer Tailwind over vanilla CSS, only utilize vanilla CSS if there is not a way to do it with Tailwind. When you do have to utilize vanilla CSS prefer to use @apply rules that utilize Tailwind classes.
